sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as API caller
    participant S as Transactional sends
    participant M as Manager
    participant W as Worker
    participant T as Run history, status rows
    C->>S: POST emails/{id}/cancel/, JWT team only
    S->>M: cancelUnclaimed(team, id)
    Note right of M: UPDATE status = canceled,<br/>last_transition = now()<br/>WHERE available AND<br/>transition_count = 0,<br/>no SKIP LOCKED
    alt the worker claimed it first
        W->>M: fairDequeueJobs holds the row lock
        Note right of M: the UPDATE waits, re-checks<br/>the row, matches nothing
        M-->>S: claimed
        S-->>C: 409 already_sending
    else the cancel locked it first
        Note over M,W: SKIP LOCKED passes over the row
        M-->>S: canceled, with state
        Note right of S: decodeJobState,<br/>hogFlow: { id: functionId }
        S->>T: run row canceled, status row canceled, flush
        Note right of S: canceled and triggered<br/>metrics, log
        S-->>C: 200 canceled
    else Q3 a quick retry after a crash before the rows
        M-->>S: already_canceled, with state
        S->>T: run row canceled, status row canceled, flush
        S-->>C: 200 canceled
    else wrong team, no such job, or the janitor deleted it
        M-->>S: not_found
        S-->>C: 404
    end
